{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2022-08-26 09:52:00', 'title': 'PFIZER AND BIONTECH COMPLETE SUBMISSION TO EUROPEAN MEDICINES AGENCY FOR OMICRON BA.4/BA.5 ADAPTED BIVALENT VACCINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK & MAINZ, GERMANY--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PFIZER INC. (NYSE: PFE) AND BIONTECH SE (NASDAQ: BNTX) TODAY ANNOUNCED THEY HAVE COMPLETED A SUBMISSION TO THE EUROPEAN MEDICINES AGENCY (EMA) FOR A BOOSTER DOSE OF AN OMICRON BA.4/BA.5-ADAPTED BIVALENT COVID-19 VACCINE FOR INDIVIDUALS 12 YEARS OF AGE AND OLDER. THIS APPLICATION FOR A VARIATION OF THE CONDITIONAL MARKETING AUTHORIZATION (CMA) FOLLOWS GUIDANCE FROM THE EMA AND INTERNATIONAL COALITION OF MEDICINES REGULATORY AUTHORITIES (ICMRA) TO WORK'}